Crawford Reeves was an agent of [[Org/Concordia/index|Concordia]], one of two Concordia agents sent after [[Phenomena/Keystone|keystone 14]] in [[Geography/Calaria/Hallia/index|Hallia]]. He wore his raiment and the org's yellow, a smiley face on the chest, and his long pinkish hair moved as if in a wind of its own, even indoors. He spoke from a clipboard, reading out Concordia's charter, and fought with a dance that pulled the eye and the feet toward him and with his razor hair.

He is dead. He died at the [[Geography/Calaria/Hallia/Sableclutch/Prime Meridian Sub Transit Nexus|Sub Transit Nexus]], alongside his partner [[Org/Concordia/People/Louis Maller|Louis Maller]], when a gear that [[Org/Prime Meridian/Rapid Connection|Rapid Connection]] had burned into his brow burst and he came apart in rust. He carried no weapons and no identification, only a small green stone, opaque and faintly translucent, that is magic and does nothing at all.
